<title>USA: Great Western Financial earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Great Western Financial earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dec. 31, 1996     Q4     Dec. 31, 1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.01		    $0.67</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.01		     0.66</p>
<p> Net			  5,132		   98,567</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     140,408		  138,957</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     140,434		  139,081</p>
<p>					    YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.69		    $1.72</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.69		     1.71</p>
<p> Net			115,822		  261,022</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     138,505		  137,111</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     139,250		  137,951</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 and year 1996 include a one-time restructuring charge of about $68.3 million.</p>
<p>Excluding extraordinary items, Q4 operating income was $0.58/shr.</p>
<p>Full company name is Great Western Financial Corp.</p>
